                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Good:\n+ Art style .\n+ Animation work.\n+ Numbers of ref. for game background stories.\n\nBad:\n- Keyboard input is abysmal – even fails to response when two keys are pressed.\n- Input lag\n- Infuriating slow-motion sequences – lock out all input when playing MEANINGLESS slow-motion sequences.\n- Boss design is BAD – every encounter boils down to spamming adds and cluttering the arena with projectiles, rather than offering interesting mechanics.\n- Secret items placed in boss arenas are practically unobtainable – no time to collect during the fight, and the stage quits immediately (around 3sec) after victory, robbing you of any chance to explore.\n\n4.5/10",
